# [The Breaker's Yard](heart_relic_doc)

The fourth piece, in the one ruin somebody else is already living in.

**Mixed, and wrong.** XORN cut this hulk open to get at what was inside it, so the
structure is half giant-built chamber and half breaker's cut: square holes hacked through
round rooms, a service trench opened up the side of it, and a yard where they stack what
they strip. The architecture tells you the story before Storm does - nobody flies a ruin
this shape by accident, and the ruin did not used to be this shape.

**This is the episode with something in it.** `Spawn:` puts a picket in the yard and a
second in the trench, waking when the crew reaches them - the only relic in the campaign
that fights back from the inside.

