## [Dialogue](dialogue)

What the Heart's places say. See the Voice's file for how a place scene works.

### [The Yard](heart_yard_look)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_plate_stack
---
% The yard is a scrapyard inside a corpse: cut plate stacked to the ceiling, cable coiled in heaps, a lifter frozen mid-reach. Somebody was working here recently, as ruins go - the cut edges are still bright.

- [Check the cut edges](heart_yard_edges) if engineering ; check engineering 7 else heart_yard_dull
- [Work out what the pickets were guarding](heart_yard_pickets) if weapons ; check weapons 8 else heart_yard_nothing, reveal heart_stash, signal heart_stash_found
- [Listen in on XORN's band](heart_yard_band) if comms ; check comms 8 else heart_yard_static, signal heart_band_heard
- [Move on]()

### [XORN Cutting](heart_yard_edges)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_plate_stack
---
% XORN cutting gear - you would know the burn anywhere. Months old at most. They were here, they stripped half a giant, and they left in a hurry without the best of it.

- [Tell Vex](heart_yard_vex)

### [Vex, on the Cutting](heart_yard_vex)
---
Speaker: chief_vex
---
% Vex. That's XORN pattern cutting, and it's good work - better than ours, and I don't say that often. If they left gear behind, I want it. Look for where they'd have kept it.

- [Will do]()

### [Just Metal](heart_yard_dull)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_plate_stack
---
% Cut metal, a great deal of it. Whose, and when, you cannot say.

- [Look again](heart_yard_look)
- [Move on]()

### [What the Pickets Kept](heart_yard_pickets)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_plate_stack
---
% The pickets were not guarding the yard. They were guarding a gap behind the plate stack: somebody's stash, tucked where the yard lamps do not reach.

- [Mark it]()

### [Nothing Worth Guarding](heart_yard_nothing)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_plate_stack
---
% Whatever the pickets were watching, it is not obvious from here.

- [Look again](heart_yard_look)
- [Move on]()

### [Counting Cuts](heart_yard_band)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_lamp
---
% XORN's work band, still live on a relay somewhere outside. A voice counting off cuts, flat and bored: "...eleven. Twelve. The Heart comes out whole or the client does not pay. Thirteen..."

- [Log it]()

### [Static](heart_yard_static)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_plate_stack
---
% Static, and under it something that might be a voice, or might be the hull settling.

- [Listen again](heart_yard_look)
- [Move on]()

### [The Cutter's Stash](heart_stash_look)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_lamp
---
% A XORN cutter's stash: a plasma cutter in its case, spare charges, and a mug somebody is going to miss. The cutter is worth more than everything else in this yard.

- [Tell Vex](heart_stash_vex)
- [Reel it in]()

### [Vex, on the Cutter](heart_stash_vex)
---
Speaker: chief_vex
---
% A XORN cutter? Intact? Bring it. Bring the charges. Don't let Eddy see it before I do.

- [On our way]()

### [The Drum](heart_drum_look)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_wall_a
---
% The drum is a giant's room, round and enormous, and XORN hacked a square hole in its far side without a second look at what they were cutting through. Below the hole the trench drops straight down into the dark.

- [Read what they cut through](heart_drum_walls) if science ; check science 8 else heart_drum_char, signal heart_bands_read
- [Mark a way down the trench](heart_drum_trench) if helm ; check helm 7 else heart_drum_tight, signal heart_trench_marked
- [Move on]()

### [Rings of a Tree](heart_drum_walls)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_wall_a
---
% Between the burn scars, what XORN cut through: a giant's own inscription, band after band of it, running round the drum like the rings of a tree. Most of it is slag now.

- [Tell Storm](heart_drum_storm)

### [Storm, on the Inscription](heart_drum_storm)
---
Speaker: prof_storm
---
% They cut THROUGH it? Through a - no. Record what is left. All of it, every band. Then go down there and take the Heart back from them.

- [Understood]()

### [Char](heart_drum_char)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_wall_a
---
% Char and slag. If there was anything here, the cutting took it.

- [Look again](heart_drum_look)
- [Move on]()

### [A Line Down](heart_drum_trench)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_gantry
---
% XORN hung work lamps down the trench wall every hundred metres - a line to fly by. It is tight, but a suit fits.

- [Down]()

### [Tight](heart_drum_tight)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_gantry
---
% The trench is narrower than it looked from up here. Take it slowly.

- [Try again](heart_drum_look)
- [Move on]()

### [The Trench](heart_trench_look)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_gantry
---
% The trench is XORN's cut, straight down out of the drum, and half-way down they welded a blast door across it - half finished, the weld beads still bright.

- [Unpick the weld](heart_door_free) if engineering ; check engineering 10 else heart_door_stuck, open trench_bulkhead
- [Cut it with the beam](heart_door_cut)
- [Not yet]()

### [Unpicked](heart_door_free)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_gantry
---
% The last weld bead gives. The door swings out of the trench on its one finished hinge. The way down is open.

- [Down]()

### [Welded](heart_door_stuck)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_gantry
---
% XORN welds hold. Another pair of hands, or the cutter.

- [Try again](heart_trench_look)
- [Leave it]()

### [The Cutter](heart_door_cut)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_gantry
---
% On the Fire app, arm BEAM and select the door. Their weld, your beam.

- [Understood]()

### [The Core Room](heart_core_look)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_lamp
---
% The core room, and the Heart still seated in it, with a thousand years of somebody else's cutting gear abandoned round it. XORN got this close. They did not get it out.

- [Read the Heart](heart_core_read) if science ; check science 8 else heart_core_glare
- [Find out why XORN stopped](heart_core_why) if weapons ; check weapons 7 else heart_core_nothing
- [Call Storm](heart_core_storm)
- [Get to work]()

### [Still Hot](heart_core_read)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_lamp
---
% The Heart is running - not full, not even close, but running. It powers nothing and it has not stopped in a thousand years.

- [Log it]()

### [Glare](heart_core_glare)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_lamp
---
% The Heart swamps every sensor in the suit. Back off and try again.

- [Try again](heart_core_look)
- [Leave it]()

### [Why They Stopped](heart_core_why)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_lamp
---
% Scorch on the far wall in a spray pattern, and a XORN cutting frame folded in half. The Heart bit back when they cut too close. It is still warm enough to do it again - bring it out on a long tether.

- [Understood]()

### [Nothing Obvious](heart_core_nothing)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_lamp
---
% Abandoned gear, and no sign of why. Look closer.

- [Look again](heart_core_look)
- [Move on]()

### [Storm, in the Core Room](heart_core_storm)
---
Speaker: prof_storm
---
% The Heart. They cut a hole in a thousand-year-old giant to reach it and it stopped them anyway. Scan it, tether it long, and read that work order - I want to know who they were cutting for.

- [Understood]()

### [The Plate Stack](heart_plate_look)
---
Backdrop: pic:hk_plate_stack
---
% Cut plate, stacked and ready to lift, in a hull that is not coming back for it.

- [Ask Eddy](heart_plate_eddy) if comms
- [Haul it later]()

### [Eddy, on XORN Plate](heart_plate_eddy)
---
Speaker: crazy_eddy
---
% Plate XORN cut and never collected? Oh, I would pay just to see their faces. And for the plate. Mostly for the faces.

- [We'll see]()

